message: "For this exact v0.3.0 software and synthetic benchmark archive, cite the version-specific Zenodo DOI. The concept DOI identifies the project across versions. The companion manuscript and supplementary information have no separate DOI in the supplied materials."
title: "Green Catalyst Screening: Supporting Data and Code for an Interpretable Chemoinformatics Benchmark"
