license: MIT
abstract: "Supporting code and a synthetic chemoinformatics benchmark for auditing regression models, cross-validation strategies, sensitivity to non-causal decoy descriptors, TreeSHAP attributions, and an illustrative Green Performance Index. All reaction data and targets are synthetic; they are not experimental chemistry evidence or validated predictions of catalyst performance. The archived metrics are traceable and consistency-checked, but a complete independent clean rerun has not yet succeeded. Synthetic datasets and written documentation are CC BY 4.0."
keywords:
  - chemoinformatics
  - synthetic benchmark
  - synthetic data
  - machine learning
  - model interpretability
  - catalytic alcohol oxidation
  - cross-validation
  - decoy sensitivity
  - TreeSHAP
  - reproducibility
